# Committed defaults for `task backend:dev:proprietary` (self-hosted / proprietary
# flavor). Local overrides + secrets live in app/.env.proprietary.local (ignored).

# Account linking needs nothing here. AccountLinkProperties compiles in production Stirling
# (linking and metering on, api2.stirling.com), the same defaults a Docker image runs with, so
# dev exercises what ships. To link against another SaaS, set
# STIRLING_BILLING_ACCOUNT_LINK_SAAS_BASE_URL in the .local file.
